Answering my own question

Using aes(fill= ...) and scale_fill_manual allows to do what I want

library(productplots)
library(ggplot2)
library(magrittr)
titanicdf <- as.data.frame(Titanic)
titanicdf %>%
  prodplot(Freq ~ Survived+Class+Sex,c("vspine","hspine","hspine")) + aes(fill=Survived) +
    scale_fill_manual(values=c("darkred","darkgreen"))

